    "created_at": "2016-04-15T14:37:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-15T14:37:28Z",
    "body": "The purpose is to match what (some) browsers did when this was specified (I believe IE at least). But I think this can probably be changed without breaking the Web, in particular because some other browsers (Gecko?) don't match the current spec.\n\nAlso see\nhttps://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=26113\nhttps://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=27484\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
