    "updated_at": "2016-04-15T18:03:41Z",
    "body": "Thanks for your reply, @zcorpan.\nYes, you are right. It looks like Gecko and Blink don't support this, given that they get failure result in `IDL attribute complete returns true when image resource has been fetched but not run yet & image is not in broken state` test in http://w3c-test.org/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-img-element/img.complete.html.\nDoes that mean the test can be removed, too?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
